The kernel program of the half-cut #2979 word (mdumitrean, rank7 joint end frames, PR #2979 of CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds, on Jeremy Kothe's #2957 and Mason Hale's #2917 T74 words; the 16,086 literal rank-48 heads cut by 24 of their 48 axes) by the mixed-target recursion (Theorem 1G): `MX.L2979.engine` (module `Work.L2979.Engine`) proves `MX.L2979.EngineStmt`, OpenAI's `hills_program` statement at the seam exponent `1 - 1755647301/10^12` for index types in universe 0, and `MX.L2979.EngineStmt.lift` (Work/L2979/Stmt.lean) gives every universe by `Able.reindex`.

